OL,3,GNEWSAOrwell Bridge shut after crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA major route in Suffolk has been
OL,6,Fclosed after a crash involving a
OL,7,Fpedestrian and a vehicle, police said.
OL,9,FThe Orwell Bridge, which carries the
OL,10,FA14 south of Ipswich, is shut in both
OL,11,Fdirections between junction 56 for
OL,12,FWherstead and junction 57 at the Nacton
OL,13,Finterchange.
OL,15,FThe accident happened on the bridge at
OL,16,F03:41 BST, and the road is likely to be
OL,17,Fclosed for several hours, Suffolk
OL,18,FPolice said.
OL,20,FCongestion is building up towards
OL,21,FIpswich, and the force has asked
OL,22,Fdrivers to find alternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
